#: kcmlaunch.cpp:45
msgid "<h1>Launch Feedback</h1> You can configure the application-launch feedback here."
msgstr "<h1>Cibärelü Çağılışı</h1> Yazılımnar cibärelgändä çağılışnı bonda köyläp bula."

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:49
msgid "Bus&y Cursor"
msgstr "&Yökle Kürsär"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:51
msgid ""
"<h1>Busy Cursor</h1>\n"
"KDE offers a busy cursor for application startup notification.\n"
"To enable the busy cursor, select one kind of visual feedback\n"
"from the combobox.\n"
"It may occur, that some applications are not aware of this startup\n"
"notification. In this case, the cursor stops blinking after the time\n"
"given in the section 'Startup indication timeout'"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Yökle Kürsär</h1>\n"
"Yazılım yöklänüen belderü öçen, KDE yökle kürsär kürsätergä birä.\n"
"Ul yökle kürsär qullanunı açu öçen, bu saylaw qırında anın berär tören saylísı.\n"
"Qayber yazılımnar üz yöklänü waqıtın beldermi toruınıñ da buluı bar.\n"
"Andí çaqlarda kürsär cemeldäwe 'Yöklänü kürsätü arası' digän qırında waqıt uzuınnan soñ sünäçäk."

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:69
msgid "No Busy Cursor"
msgstr "Yöktä Uqlar Yuq"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:70
msgid "Passive Busy Cursor"
msgstr "Passif Yökle Uq"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:71
msgid "Blinking Cursor"
msgstr "Cimeldüçe Kürsär"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:72
msgid "Bouncing Cursor"
msgstr "Kürsär Sikertü"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:79
msgid "&Startup indication timeout:"
msgstr "&Yöklänü kürsätü arası:"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:83 kcmlaunch.cpp:120
msgid " sec"
msgstr " sek"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:90
msgid "Taskbar &Notification"
msgstr "Yöktirädän &Belderü"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:91
msgid ""
"<H1>Taskbar Notification</H1>\n"
"You can enable a second method of startup notification which is\n"
"used by the taskbar where a button with a rotating hourglass appears,\n"
"symbolizing that your started application is loading.\n"
"It may occur, that some applications are not aware of this startup\n"
"notification. In this case, the button disappears after the time\n"
"given in the section 'Startup indication timeout'"
msgstr ""
"<H1>Yöktirädän Belderü</H1>\n"
"Yöklänü turında yöktirädän belderüne saylap bula, ul çaqta yazılım\n"
"yöklänü turında belderü öcen yöktirä töymäsendä äylängän disk kürsäteläçäk.\n"
"Qayber yazılımnar üz yöklänü turından berniçek tä beldermilär,\n"
"ul çaqta bondí belderü ısulınnan uñaylıq kürep bula.\n"
"'Yöklänüne Kürsätü Arası' digän köylämädä äytelgän ara ütkäç\n"
"disk äylänü betäçäk."

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:109
msgid "Enable &taskbar notification"
msgstr "Yök&tirä belderüen açası"

#: kcmlaunch.cpp:116
msgid "Start&up indication timeout:"
msgstr "Yöklänü kürsätü &arası:"
